data
  title Continental routing: brute force vs preprocessing
  desc Same exact shortest path — but the precomputation bargain decides query cost
  compares
    - label Plain Dijkstra / A*
      children
        - label Millions of nodes per query
          desc Fans out in all directions until it reaches the target
