    - label Contraction hierarchies
      children
        - label Thousands of nodes per query
          desc Bidirectional search rides a few high-level shortcuts
        - label Orders of magnitude faster
          desc Still returns the exact shortest path, not an approximation
        - label Hours of offline preprocessing
          desc Rank + contract nodes once; weights baked into shortcuts
